+/* The JOIN grant is only needed until the link is usable.  The vendor gen4m
+ * AIS FSM arms a JOIN timer when the grant arrives (AIS_JOIN_CH_REQUEST_
+ * INTERVAL, 4 s) and returns the grant in NORMAL_TR when it expires or DHCP
